          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "getting-therea0s",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "The Lodge is about 90 minutes’ drive south of Sydney. The map above opens directions."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "getting-therea1",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "getting-therea1s",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "We are planning to arrange a shuttle bus from Sydney. Details to follow."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        }
      ],
      "note": null,
      "question": "How do I get there? What if I don't drive?"
    },
    {
      "_key": "kids",
      "answer": [
        {
          "_key": "kidsa0",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "kidsa0s",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Yes. We are planning to hire a nanny. Add their ages to your RSVP so we can plan for them. Let us know if you would like them to be a part of the ceremony and reception dinner, or if you would prefer they are with the nanny."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        }
      ],
      "note": null,
      "question": "Are kids welcome?"
    },
    {
      "_key": "dress-code",
      "answer": [
        {
          "_key": "dress-codea0",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "dress-codea0s",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "The ceremony will take place outdoors on the wedding lawn. Dress attire should be cocktail, but think outdoor garden party. It’s summer in Sydney so vibrant jewel tones and florals are encouraged!"
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        }
      ],
      "note": "Dress code ",
      "question": "What should I wear?"
    },
    {
      "_key": "between-events",
      "answer": [
        {
          "_key": "between-eventsa0",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "between-eventsa0s",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "The pool, Swedish sauna, outdoor hot tub, gym, games room, bikes, tennis court and yard games are free for all guests. The pool has service from midday."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "between-eventsa1",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "between-eventsa1s",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "The day spa is extra. Book treatments directly with the venue."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        }
      ],
      "note": null,
      "question": "What is there to do between events?"
    },
    {
